## 16. WRECK AND RECOVERY

When all health blocks are depleted:

- Enter wrecked state.
- Disable normal acceleration temporarily.
- Trigger controlled destruction effects.
- Register the responsible attacker.
- Award valid combat reputation.
- Apply a configurable time penalty.
- Respawn at a validated track location.
- Restore the configured recovery health amount.
- Apply temporary spawn protection.

Prevent:

- Respawn abuse.
- Checkpoint skipping.
- Instant recovery exploits.
- Repeated rewards from the same wreck event.

The vehicle must remain physically present until the appropriate recovery transition.

