## 23. BOLT

Internal reference: BOLT.

Category: Precision offensive projectile.

One pickup provides exactly three individual shots.

Requirements:

- Each shot is activated separately.
- No automatic homing.
- Forward firing.
- Backward firing.
- Fast projectile movement.
- Accurate collision detection.
- Small physical disruption on hit.
- Remaining ammunition visible in the HUD.

A Bolt pickup occupies one inventory slot until all three shots are consumed or the item is discarded.

### Projectile interception

Implement the following community-inspired balancing rule:

- One Bolt weakens a Shunt.
- A second Bolt destroys the weakened Shunt.

This interaction must be configurable.

### VFX

Suggested original design:

- Pink or magenta energy projectile.
- Bright core.
- Thin fast-moving trail.
- Sharp impact effect.

Do not implement Bolt as a single three-projectile burst unless a separate mod explicitly enables that behavior.

